  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "All nitrides react with $\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}$ to give $\\mathrm{NH}_{3}$ and $\\mathrm{CaCN}_{2}$ also react with $\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O}$\n$$\n\\mathrm{CaNCN}+3 \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{O} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{CaCO}_{3}+\\mathrm{NH}_{3}\n$$"
